	(text "FPC pad numbering: with the tail pad-side up and the tip pointing up, P1 is the left-most pad (a tip-row pad), then P2 (back-row pad), and so on to P11. Insert tip-first, pads DOWN; if there is no continuity flip it (numbering then mirrors: tail pad N lands on P(12-N))."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 135.0 0)
		(effects
